# causal.kb — chains, not links: things that cause things that cause things.
#
# `CognitiveLearningCore.reach` walks a relation past its first hop, and it was almost never able
# to. Measured over 80 subjects that cause something: **4 reached a second hop**, and the reason
# turned out to be the corpus rather than the walk — only 35 two-hop causal chains existed in
# 13,483 facts to be found. Every domain file states what a thing causes and almost never states
# what *that* causes, because a writer describing one subject naturally stops at its consequences.
#
# So this file is written the other way round: each line is chosen because its object is a subject
# somewhere else, so the walk has somewhere to go. Nothing here is new knowledge about a new thing
# — it is the joins between things already in the corpus, which is exactly what a chain is.
#
# The rule every line follows: **each link is separately true and separately defensible.** A chain
# assembled from three real links is a real inference; a chain assembled from one real link and two
# convenient ones is a story, and the walk cannot tell them apart, so the writing has to.

# --- water, heat and weather ---------------------------------------------------------------- #
sunlight | causes=evaporation | causes=photosynthesis | causes=warming of the ground
evaporation | causes=water vapour | causes=cooling of the surface it leaves
water vapour | causes=condensation | causes=humidity
cloud formation | causes=precipitation | causes=reduced sunlight at the ground
precipitation | causes=runoff | causes=soil moisture
runoff | causes=erosion | causes=river flow
erosion | causes=loss of topsoil | causes=sediment in rivers
loss of topsoil | causes=lower crop yield
river flow | causes=groundwater recharge
lower crop yield | causes=food shortage | causes=higher food prices
food shortage | causes=malnutrition
higher food prices | causes=inflation

# --- heat, fire and the atmosphere ----------------------------------------------------------- #
heat | causes=evaporation | causes=convection
convection | causes=wind
wind | causes=erosion | causes=dispersal of seeds
waves | causes=coastal erosion
combustion | causes=heat | causes=smoke
smoke | causes=air pollution | causes=reduced visibility
air pollution | causes=acid rain
respiratory disease | causes=reduced lung function
greenhouse effect | causes=global warming
global warming | causes=ice melting | causes=extreme weather
ice melting | causes=sea level rise
coastal flooding | causes=displacement of people
extreme weather | causes=crop failure | causes=damage to buildings
crop failure | causes=food shortage
deforestation | causes=erosion | causes=habitat loss | causes=carbon dioxide
habitat loss | causes=species decline
species decline | causes=extinction

# --- the body ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ #
fever | causes=dehydration
dehydration | causes=fatigue | causes=headache
fatigue | causes=reduced concentration
reduced concentration | causes=mistakes
exercise | causes=increased heart rate | causes=sweating | causes=fitness
increased heart rate | causes=greater blood flow
sweating | causes=cooling of the body | causes=water loss
water loss | causes=dehydration
poor sleep | causes=fatigue | causes=weakened immunity
weakened immunity | causes=infection
smoking | causes=lung damage
lung damage | causes=reduced lung function
mosquito bite | causes=itching | causes=malaria in an infected area
malaria | causes=fever

# --- plants and food ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
glucose | causes=stored energy
irrigation | causes=soil moisture | causes=higher yield
soil moisture | causes=germination
germination | causes=seedling growth | causes=root development
root development | causes=better water uptake
fertiliser | causes=faster growth | causes=runoff of nutrients
runoff of nutrients | causes=eutrophication
eutrophication | causes=oxygen depletion
algal bloom | causes=oxygen depletion
oxygen depletion | causes=fish dying
overgrazing | causes=loss of topsoil | causes=desertification
crop rotation | causes=soil fertility
soil fertility | causes=higher yield
higher yield | causes=food surplus
food surplus | causes=lower food prices | causes=trade

# --- machines, power and cities ------------------------------------------------------------------------ #
burning coal | causes=steam | causes=carbon dioxide | causes=air pollution
steam | causes=turbine rotation
turbine rotation | causes=electricity generation
electricity generation | causes=lighting | causes=refrigeration | causes=waste heat
refrigeration | causes=longer food storage
longer food storage | causes=less food waste
waste heat | causes=warming of the surroundings
industrialisation | causes=urbanisation | causes=air pollution | causes=higher output
urbanisation | causes=crowding | causes=demand for housing
crowding | causes=faster disease spread
faster disease spread | causes=epidemic
demand for housing | causes=higher rents
traffic congestion | causes=delay | causes=air pollution | causes=fuel waste
fuel waste | causes=higher costs
mechanisation | causes=higher output | causes=fewer jobs in that task
higher output | causes=lower unit cost
lower unit cost | causes=lower prices
lower prices | causes=higher demand

# --- learning, work and society ------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
practice | causes=confidence
skill | causes=better performance | causes=higher earnings
better performance | causes=recognition
education | causes=literacy | causes=skill | causes=informed choices
literacy | causes=access to information
access to information | causes=informed choices
informed choices | causes=better outcomes
sanitation | causes=fewer infections
fewer infections | causes=lower child mortality
vaccination | causes=immunity | causes=fewer infections
immunity | causes=protection against reinfection
clean water | causes=fewer infections
poverty | causes=malnutrition | causes=limited access to education
limited access to education | causes=fewer opportunities
unemployment | causes=loss of income
loss of income | causes=poverty
inflation | causes=reduced purchasing power
reduced purchasing power | causes=lower demand
trust | causes=cooperation | causes=lower transaction costs
cooperation | causes=shared effort
misinformation | causes=false beliefs
false beliefs | causes=poor decisions
poor decisions | causes=avoidable harm
